{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：少数感受词堆叠过密，个别表达抽象或跳跃（如“我与你的亲密关系”“对生命的眷恋”），不如X的双栏短词利落自然。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y用放大加亮的关键词让观众不必读完每句话，就能抓住每段心理变化；感受小字与按乐句出现的安排，也让细节能够跟着音乐逐步进入，不必一次消化。更重要的是，Y保留了更多心理转折之间的因果关系，尤其是从怕给对方添负担，到渴望被需要，再到害怕失去亲近，最后接受自己不再隐藏喜欢的过程。X的完整句子读起来更顺、更自然，但部分情绪动机和音乐细节被压缩了。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5219bb98-4f96-4a23-b02f-27538e90dcb3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T205703661014Z", "elapsed_seconds": 150.671, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T20:59:34.340337+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "12b3ceecdd3507bf5465a4fd1ee8e9d16e080aa72ec85053a59d85fcbc1f829a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attach